  "referenceNumber": "CAF0018",
  "remarks": "\nAleksandr Grigorievitch MALOLETKO is an involved person under the Central African Republic (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2020 as he is a member of, or associated with, an involved person, namely Wagner Group. Wagner Group is or has been an involved person under the Regulations since it is or has engaged in a relevant activity, namely the commission of violations of international humanitarian law in the Central African Republic, in particular the deliberate targeting of civilians. \n",
